0:{"buildId":"rCjQE_2g3twJDQFHK8NiA","data":[{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[[["$","$L2",null,{"titleAs":"h1","heading":"Bye Phone. Hey Genie.","lede":"Your wish is my command. Say “Hey Genie.” The lamp is an on-demand concierge, awake 24/7. Guests can ask three million wishes, and Genie grants them with a high speed and consistency. With the guest’s card on file and their say-so, a prompt can order from DoorDash, Amazon, or Instacart."}],["$","section",null,{"className":"relative py-24 md:py-32 pt-0","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto w-full px-5 max-w-6xl","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3","children":[["$","article","Two kinds of stay",{"className":"rounded-[24px] border border-[#d4af37]/35 p-5","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-lg text-ink","children":"Two kinds of stay"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-mist","children":"Between two queen beds in a hotel, or on the kitchen counter of a house. Say “Hey Genie,” and the same concierge answers."}]]}],["$","article","Same rules",{"className":"rounded-[24px] border border-[#d4af37]/35 p-5","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-lg text-ink","children":"Same rules"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-mist","children":"A voice request is meant to follow the same policies as a text. “Send maintenance” should become a task, not a novelty."}]]}],["$","article","No second product",{"className":"rounded-[24px] border border-[#d4af37]/35 p-5","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-lg text-ink","children":"No second product"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-mist","children":"The lamp is the physical edge of the operating layer. It is not a separate chatbot with a different brain."}]]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-6 max-w-2xl text-sm text-mist","children":"Hardware pricing and shipping are not published here. The room shown is a visualization of the lamp on a